AHS.TeachingMaterialContentStore["tm_1"] = {"summary":{"materialId":"tm_1","coreConcepts":["正弦定理（外接圓半徑）：a/sinA = b/sinB = c/sinC = 2R，可用於求邊長、求外接圓半徑、求任一弦所對圓周角的正弦值","餘弦定理：c² = a² + b² − 2ab·cosC，可用於已知三邊求角、已知兩邊夾角求第三邊","圓內接四邊形性質：對角互補（∠A+∠C=180°），可用兩條對角線分別在兩個三角形中套用餘弦定理求對角線長","三角形面積公式：(1/2)ab·sinC；三邊長已知時可用海龍公式 √[s(s-a)(s-b)(s-c)]","和角公式的幾何證明：利用共用斜邊的兩個直角三角形推導 sin(θ±φ)、cos(θ±φ)","方位角（bearing）在餘弦定理上的應用：兩方位角之間的夾角 = 兩方位角與南（或北）基準線的夾角相加或相減","單位圓上的三角函數定義：以圓上一點的坐標定義 sinθ、cosθ，並以切線段定義 tanθ","三角形面積平分（PQ 最小值）問題：以夾角餘弦定理配合算術幾何平均不等式（AM-GM）求最小值"],"definitions":["正弦定理：任意三角形中，各邊與其對角正弦之比相等，且等於外接圓直徑 2R","餘弦定理：三角形中任一邊的平方，等於其他兩邊平方和減去這兩邊與其夾角餘弦乘積的兩倍","圓內接四邊形：四個頂點都在同一圓上的四邊形，其對角互補","海龍公式：三邊長為 a、b、c，令 s=(a+b+c)/2，則面積 = √[s(s-a)(s-b)(s-c)]"],"pitfalls":["第 5 題選項(1)(2)刻意設計為錯誤答案（正確 BD=7、sin∠BCD=√3/2），需完整計算，不能只套一半公式就作答","方位角問題中「東南方」「南15°西」等描述，容易忽略兩方位角需先各自轉換為與南方基準線的夾角，再相加/相減才是正確的夾角","第 6 題中，若角θ落在使 cosθ 為負的象限，圖形上以「線段長度」（恆為正）表示的 OD 不會直接等於帶正負號的 cosθ，需特別留意「幾何長度」與「三角函數值（含正負號）」的差異，本題答案建議教師/人工再次確認圖形中θ所在象限後覆核","面積平分為兩點問題（F 題）常見誤解為「兩點皆取中點」，但唯有當兩邊夾角固定、乘積固定時，等長（p=q）才是最小值成立的條件，需以 AM-GM 嚴謹證明"],"memorize":["第 1 題：利用兩個共用斜邊 AD 的直角三角形（∠ABD=∠ACD=90°）推導出 CD = a·sinθ − b·cosθ，是和角公式 sin(θ−φ) 展開的幾何證明類型","第 3、5 題：圓內接四邊形中，弦長 = 2R·sin(所對圓周角)，是正弦定理在圓幾何中的延伸應用","第 5 題：四邊形對角互補（∠A+∠C=180°），配合餘弦定理對同一條對角線列兩次方程式求解，是本單元的核心解題手法","第 6 題：單位圓上以坐標定義 sinθ、cosθ，並以切線段定義 tanθ = sinθ/cosθ，需留意角度所在象限對「有向量」與「幾何長度」的正負號差異","D 題：方位角問題中，兩個方位角（如「東南方」= 南偏東45°、「南15°西」）需先轉換成與同一基準方向（南）的夾角，再相加或相減得到夾角，才能套用餘弦定理","F 題：三角形內兩邊上取點使線段平分面積，其乘積為定值（由面積條件決定），最小值需用 AM-GM 不等式求得，而非直接假設為中點"],"reviewSuggestions":["熟練正弦定理、餘弦定理在一般三角形與圓內接四邊形中的雙重應用","多練習方位角轉換為標準角度夾角的作圖與計算","複習海龍公式與三角形面積的多種求法，並比較各方法的適用時機","針對第 6 題重新對照原始圖形，確認 θ 所在象限後再次核對答案"],"subject":"數學","grade":"高一","chapter":"第二冊 第4章 4-1~4-3（三角函數的性質：正弦定理、餘弦定理、三角形面積公式）","section":"114學年度下學期 高一第三次段考","title":"第二冊 第4章 4-1~4-3（三角函數的性質：正弦定理、餘弦定理、三角形面積公式） 114學年度下學期 高一第三次段考"},"questions":[{"id":"tm_1_q1","materialId":"tm_1","questionNumber":"1","type":"single_choice","question":"如圖，∠BAC=θ，∠ABD=∠ACD=90°，AB=a，BD=b，下列選項何者可以表示 CD？（圖形為四邊形ABDC：B、C分別是以AD為斜邊的兩個直角三角形之直角頂點，∠ABD、∠ACD皆為直角）","options":["(1) a sinθ + b cosθ","(2) a sinθ + b tanθ","(3) a cosθ − b sinθ","(4) a cosθ + b sinθ","(5) a sinθ − b cosθ"],"answer":"(5) a sinθ − b cosθ","explanation":"由∠ABD=90°知AD=√(a²+b²)，設∠BAD=φ則sinφ=b/AD、cosφ=a/AD；∠ACD=90°表示C在以AD為直徑的圓上，∠DAC=θ−φ，故CD=AD·sin(θ−φ)=AD sinθ cosφ − AD cosθ sinφ = a sinθ − b cosθ。","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":1,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.97,"needsReview":false,"knowledgePoint":"和角公式的幾何證明","figureSvg":"<svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 260\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">\n<line x1=\"160\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<line x1=\"70\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"230\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<line x1=\"160\" y1=\"230\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<line x1=\"250\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<line x1=\"160\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"230\" stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/>\n<rect x=\"78\" y=\"132\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" transform=\"rotate(-52 85 139)\"/>\n<rect x=\"222\" y=\"134\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" transform=\"rotate(38 229 141)\"/>\n<circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"30\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#333\"/><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"150\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#333\"/>\n<circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"230\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#333\"/><circle cx=\"250\" cy=\"140\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#333\"/>\n<text x=\"160\" y=\"20\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">A</text>\n<text x=\"55\" y=\"152\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">B</text>\n<text x=\"160\" y=\"250\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">D</text>\n<text x=\"266\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">C</text>\n<text x=\"118\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#7c5cff\">θ</text>\n<text x=\"97\" y=\"98\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#555\">a</text>\n<text x=\"98\" y=\"196\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#555\">b</text>\n</svg>"},{"id":"tm_1_q2","materialId":"tm_1","questionNumber":"2","type":"single_choice","question":"如圖，△ABC為等腰直角三角形，D為BC的中點，則 tan∠DAB 為？（圖形中AC邊標示長度為√2，據此判斷直角頂點在B，AB=BC為兩股、AC為斜邊）","options":["(1) 1/2","(2) 1/3","(3) 1/4","(4) 1/5","(5) 1/6"],"answer":"(1) 1/2","explanation":"設直角在B，AB=BC=1（斜邊AC=√2）。取B為原點，A=(0,1)，C=(1,0)，D為BC中點=(0.5,0)。向量AD=(0.5,−1)、AB=(0,−1)，tan∠DAB=|cross|/dot=0.5/1=1/2。此題原始照片中該小圖的直角頂點位置與邊長標示較不清晰，是根據√2標示於AC邊、且與考生原始答案(1)一致而推得，建議人工對照原稿圖形覆核。","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":1,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.85,"needsReview":true,"knowledgePoint":"三角函數定義、坐標法求角","figureSvg":"<svg viewBox=\"0 0 300 240\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">\n<line x1=\"60\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<line x1=\"60\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<line x1=\"60\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<line x1=\"60\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#7c5cff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<line x1=\"60\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#7c5cff\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/>\n<rect x=\"60\" y=\"186\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/>\n<circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"200\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#7c5cff\"/>\n<text x=\"45\" y=\"55\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">A</text>\n<text x=\"42\" y=\"216\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">B</text>\n<text x=\"228\" y=\"205\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">C</text>\n<text x=\"140\" y=\"220\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#7c5cff\">D</text>\n<text x=\"150\" y=\"130\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#555\">√2</text>\n<text x=\"90\" y=\"215\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#999\">中點</text>\n</svg>"},{"id":"tm_1_q3","materialId":"tm_1","questionNumber":"3","type":"single_choice","question":"如下圖，設圓內接四邊形ABCD中∠CAD=30°，∠ACB=45°，CD=2，則 AB=?（圖形為圓內接四邊形ABCD，四頂點依序排列於同一圓上）","options":["(1) 2","(2) 2√2","(3) 3","(4) 2√3","(5) 4"],"answer":"(2) 2√2","explanation":"設外接圓半徑為R。CD所對圓周角∠CAD=30°，故CD=2R sin30°=2 ⟹ R=2。AB所對圓周角∠ACB=45°，故AB=2R sin45°=2×2×(√2/2)=2√2。","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":1,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.97,"needsReview":false,"knowledgePoint":"正弦定理、圓內接四邊形","figureSvg":"<svg viewBox=\"0 0 300 300\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">\n<circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"150\" r=\"110\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ccc\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"40\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#333\"/>\n<circle cx=\"52\" cy=\"128\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#333\"/>\n<circle cx=\"95\" cy=\"252\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#333\"/>\n<circle cx=\"248\" cy=\"128\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#333\"/>\n<line x1=\"150\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"52\" y2=\"128\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<line x1=\"52\" y1=\"128\" x2=\"95\" y2=\"252\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<line x1=\"95\" y1=\"252\" x2=\"248\" y2=\"128\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<line x1=\"248\" y1=\"128\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<line x1=\"150\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"95\" y2=\"252\" stroke=\"#7c5cff\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/>\n<line x1=\"52\" y1=\"128\" x2=\"248\" y2=\"128\" stroke=\"#22b573\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/>\n<text x=\"150\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">A</text>\n<text x=\"34\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">B</text>\n<text x=\"88\" y=\"272\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">C</text>\n<text x=\"264\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">D</text>\n<text x=\"132\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7c5cff\">30°</text>\n<text x=\"80\" y=\"120\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#22b573\">45°</text>\n<text x=\"170\" y=\"200\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#555\">CD=2</text>\n</svg>"},{"id":"tm_1_q4","materialId":"tm_1","questionNumber":"4","type":"single_choice","question":"【多選題】若有向角θ的始邊為x軸正向，終邊上一點P的坐標為P(x,−5√2)，且tanθ=√2，則下列何者正確？","options":["(1) x=5","(2) x=−5","(3) sinθ=√6/3","(4) sinθ=−√6/3","(5) cosθ=−√3/3"],"answer":"(2)(4)(5)","explanation":"此題原始為多選題，本Repository schema目前僅提供single_choice類型（無multiple_choice/multi_select枚舉值），Claude判斷以single_choice表示、並在answer欄位列出全部正確選項，屬於未修改LOCKED schema前提下的判斷（已在QA紀錄中揭露）。計算：tanθ=y/x=−5√2/x=√2 ⟹ x=−5（(1)錯(2)對）。r=√(x²+y²)=√75=5√3。sinθ=y/r=−√6/3（(3)錯(4)對）。cosθ=x/r=−√3/3（(5)對）。","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":1,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.97,"needsReview":false,"knowledgePoint":"三角函數定義、坐標法"},{"id":"tm_1_q5","materialId":"tm_1","questionNumber":"5","type":"single_choice","question":"【多選題】圓內接四邊形ABCD，已知AB=8、BC=5、CD=3、DA=5，試問下列各選項何者正確？","options":["(1) BD=√55","(2) sin∠BCD=√3/4","(3) △BCD面積為15√3/4","(4) 四邊形ABCD面積為55√3/4","(5) 外接圓半徑為7√3/3"],"answer":"(3)(4)(5)","explanation":"同Q4，schema無multi_select類型，以single_choice表示、answer列出全部正確選項。設∠DAB=A，∠BCD=180°−A。BD²=89−80cosA=34+30cosA ⟹ cosA=1/2，A=60°，BD=7（(1)錯）。∠BCD=120°，sin∠BCD=√3/2（(2)錯）。△BCD面積=(1/2)(5)(3)sin120°=15√3/4（(3)對）。海龍公式驗證四邊形總面積=55√3/4（(4)對）。BD/sinA=2R ⟹ R=7√3/3（(5)對）。","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":2,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.97,"needsReview":false,"knowledgePoint":"餘弦定理、圓內接四邊形、海龍公式、正弦定理"},{"id":"tm_1_q6","materialId":"tm_1","questionNumber":"6","type":"single_choice","question":"【多選題】如圖，θ的終邊與單位圓（半徑為1的圓）交於C點，又分別與過A、過B且垂直於坐標軸的直線交於E、F點，C點在x軸的投影點為D，則下列何者正確？（圖形中A、B分別為單位圓與y軸、x軸的交點，θ角依圖示似落於第二象限附近，確切象限無法從照片完全判讀）","options":["(1) CD=sinθ","(2) OD=cosθ","(3) BF=tanθ","(4) CD²+OD²=1","(5) BF=CD/OD"],"answer":"(3)(4)","explanation":"此答案取自原始試卷考生自行標記之答案（(3)(4)成立、(5)劃掉排除）。因原圖θ所在象限無法從照片完全確認，若cosθ為負，OD作為幾何長度未必等於帶負號的cosθ，會影響(1)(2)(5)是否成立的判斷，Claude無法獨立驗證此圖形細節，建議人工對照原始圖形覆核後再定案。","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":2,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.85,"needsReview":true,"knowledgePoint":"單位圓上的三角函數定義","figureMissing":true},{"id":"tm_1_qA","materialId":"tm_1","questionNumber":"A","type":"fill_blank","question":"如圖，BC是直徑為3的圓內一弦，BC=1，P點為圓上的動點，則 sin∠BPC = ___。","options":[],"answer":"1/3","explanation":"弦長=2R·sin(所對圓周角)：BC/sin∠BPC=直徑=3 ⟹ sin∠BPC=1/3。","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":2,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.96,"needsReview":false,"knowledgePoint":"正弦定理（圓內弦與圓周角）","figureSvg":"<svg viewBox=\"0 0 280 280\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">\n<circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"140\" r=\"100\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ccc\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<circle cx=\"90\" cy=\"55\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#333\"/>\n<circle cx=\"190\" cy=\"55\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#333\"/>\n<circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"200\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#7c5cff\"/>\n<line x1=\"90\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"55\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<line x1=\"60\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"90\" y2=\"55\" stroke=\"#7c5cff\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<line x1=\"60\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"55\" stroke=\"#7c5cff\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<text x=\"90\" y=\"42\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">B</text>\n<text x=\"190\" y=\"42\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">C</text>\n<text x=\"45\" y=\"205\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#7c5cff\">P</text>\n<text x=\"140\" y=\"46\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#555\">BC=1</text>\n<text x=\"60\" y=\"130\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#999\">直徑=3</text>\n</svg>"},{"id":"tm_1_qB","materialId":"tm_1","questionNumber":"B","type":"fill_blank","question":"△ABC中，D為BC上一點，若AB=7，BD=4，AD=5，CD=6，則 AC = ___。","options":[],"answer":"7","explanation":"△ABD中cos∠ADB=(25+16−49)/(2·5·4)=−1/5。∠ADC=180°−∠ADB，cos∠ADC=1/5。△ADC中AC²=25+36−2(5)(6)(1/5)=61−12=49，AC=7。","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":2,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.96,"needsReview":false,"knowledgePoint":"餘弦定理（鄰補角）"},{"id":"tm_1_qC","materialId":"tm_1","questionNumber":"C","type":"fill_blank","question":"如圖，在△ABC中，已知AB=6，AC=3，∠BAD=∠CAD=60°，求 AD 之值 = ___。（D為BC上一點，AD為∠BAC的角平分線）","options":[],"answer":"2","explanation":"∠BAC=120°。由[ABD]+[ADC]=[ABC]：(1/2)AD·sin60°·(AB+AC)=(1/2)·AB·AC·sin120° ⟹ (1/2)(AD)(√3/2)(9)=(1/2)(18)(√3/2) ⟹ AD=2。","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":3,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.96,"needsReview":false,"knowledgePoint":"角平分線與三角形面積","figureSvg":"<svg viewBox=\"0 0 300 220\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">\n<line x1=\"150\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"190\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<line x1=\"150\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"260\" y2=\"190\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<line x1=\"40\" y1=\"190\" x2=\"260\" y2=\"190\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<line x1=\"150\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"190\" stroke=\"#7c5cff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"190\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#7c5cff\"/>\n<text x=\"150\" y=\"20\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">A</text>\n<text x=\"25\" y=\"200\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">B</text>\n<text x=\"275\" y=\"200\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">C</text>\n<text x=\"150\" y=\"205\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#7c5cff\">D</text>\n<text x=\"118\" y=\"75\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7c5cff\">60°</text>\n<text x=\"168\" y=\"75\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#7c5cff\">60°</text>\n<text x=\"80\" y=\"120\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#555\">AB=6</text>\n<text x=\"195\" y=\"120\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#555\">AC=3</text>\n</svg>"},{"id":"tm_1_qD","materialId":"tm_1","questionNumber":"D","type":"fill_blank","question":"氣象局測出在100小時期間，颱風中心的位置由恆春東南方800公里直線移動到恆春南15°西的500公里處，試求颱風移動的平均速度為 ___ 公里/小時。","options":[],"answer":"7","explanation":"「東南方」即南偏東45°，「南15°西」即南偏西15°，兩方位角與南方基準線的夾角相加=60°。餘弦定理：距離²=800²+500²−2(800)(500)cos60°=640000+250000−400000=490000，距離=700公里，平均速度=700÷100=7公里/小時。原始試卷考生手寫答案為3，與此處獨立推導結果不同，可能為考生計算誤差，建議人工複核。","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":3,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.93,"needsReview":true,"knowledgePoint":"餘弦定理（方位角應用）"},{"id":"tm_1_qE","materialId":"tm_1","questionNumber":"E","type":"fill_blank","question":"△ABC的三邊長分別為5、6、7，試求：△ABC的面積 = ___。","options":[],"answer":"6√6","explanation":"海龍公式：s=(5+6+7)/2=9，面積=√[9(9−5)(9−6)(9−7)]=√(9×4×3×2)=√216=6√6。","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":3,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.97,"needsReview":false,"knowledgePoint":"海龍公式"},{"id":"tm_1_qF","materialId":"tm_1","questionNumber":"F","type":"fill_blank","question":"△ABC中，AB=5，BC=3，CA=4，在線段AB上取一點P，在線段AC上取一點Q，使得線段PQ將△ABC的面積平分，求線段PQ之最小值為 ___。","options":[],"answer":"2","explanation":"AB=5,BC=3,CA=4為3-4-5直角三角形，直角在C，cosA=4/5,sinA=3/5。設AP=p,AQ=q，[APQ]=(1/2)pq sinA=一半總面積3 ⟹ pq=10。PQ²=p²+q²−2pq cosA=p²+q²−16，由AM-GM，p²+q²≥2pq=20（p=q=√10時取等，且√10<4，符合P、Q在線段上），故PQ最小值=2。原始試卷考生手寫答案為3，與此處獨立推導結果不同，可能為考生計算誤差，建議人工複核。","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":3,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.93,"needsReview":true,"knowledgePoint":"餘弦定理、AM-GM不等式、面積平分"},{"id":"tm_1_qG","materialId":"tm_1","questionNumber":"G","type":"fill_blank","question":"若θ角終邊在 2x+y=0 上，則 (2cosθ−sinθ)/(3sinθ−cosθ) = ___。","options":[],"answer":"−4/7","explanation":"直線2x+y=0上任一點滿足y=−2x，故tanθ=−2。分子分母同除cosθ：(2−tanθ)/(3tanθ−1)=(2−(−2))/(3(−2)−1)=4/(−7)=−4/7。","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":3,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.97,"needsReview":false,"knowledgePoint":"同角三角函數關係（化為tanθ）"},{"id":"tm_1_qH","materialId":"tm_1","questionNumber":"H","type":"fill_blank","question":"已知θ為銳角，且 sinθ+cosθ=√5/2，求 sinθcosθ 的值為 ___。","options":[],"answer":"1/8","explanation":"(sinθ+cosθ)²=1+2sinθcosθ=5/4 ⟹ 2sinθcosθ=1/4 ⟹ sinθcosθ=1/8。","questionSource":"ORIGINAL","origin":"Uploaded Material","page":3,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","ocrConfidence":0.97,"needsReview":false,"knowledgePoint":"同角三角函數關係（平方展開）"},{"id":"tm_18_q1","materialId":"tm_1","questionNumber":"1","type":"single_choice","question":"△ABC 中，a = 7、b = 5、c = 3，則 ∠A 為多少？","options":["60°","90°","120°","150°"],"answer":"120°","explanation":"由餘弦定理 cosA = (b² + c² − a²)/(2bc) = (25 + 9 − 49)/(2·5·3) = −15/30 = −1/2，且 0° < A < 180°，所以 A = 120°。a 是最長邊，cosA < 0 也說明 ∠A 是鈍角，可直接排除 (A)(B)。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":null,"version":"2","createdDate":"2026-10-01T15:27:08.460Z","knowledgePoint":"餘弦定理（已知三邊求角）","difficulty":"易","reference":"AI 自編（非課本原題），依 tm_1 段考命題範圍「餘弦定理（已知三邊求角）」出題；答案經程式數值驗算（source/verify-tm1.js）","supplementId":"tm_18"},{"id":"tm_18_q2","materialId":"tm_1","questionNumber":"2","type":"single_choice","question":"△ABC 中，∠A = 60°、b = 8、c = 5，則 a = ？","options":["6","7","√89","√129"],"answer":"7","explanation":"a² = b² + c² − 2bc·cosA = 64 + 25 − 2·8·5·(1/2) = 89 − 40 = 49，所以 a = 7。選 (C) 是忘了減去 2bc·cosA；選 (D) 是把 cos60° 的符號弄反（變成 89 + 40）。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":null,"version":"2","createdDate":"2026-10-01T15:27:08.460Z","knowledgePoint":"餘弦定理（已知兩邊夾角求第三邊）","difficulty":"易","reference":"AI 自編（非課本原題），依 tm_1 段考命題範圍「餘弦定理（已知兩邊夾角求第三邊）」出題；答案經程式數值驗算（source/verify-tm1.js）","supplementId":"tm_18"},{"id":"tm_18_q3","materialId":"tm_1","questionNumber":"3","type":"single_choice","question":"△ABC 中，a = 6、∠A = 30°，則 △ABC 外接圓的半徑 R = ？","options":["6","3","12","6√3"],"answer":"6","explanation":"正弦定理 a / sinA = 2R，6 / (1/2) = 12 = 2R，所以 R = 6。選 (C) 是把 2R 當成 R。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":null,"version":"2","createdDate":"2026-10-01T15:27:08.460Z","knowledgePoint":"正弦定理與外接圓半徑","difficulty":"易","reference":"AI 自編（非課本原題），依 tm_1 段考命題範圍「正弦定理與外接圓半徑」出題；答案經程式數值驗算（source/verify-tm1.js）","supplementId":"tm_18"},{"id":"tm_18_q4","materialId":"tm_1","questionNumber":"4","type":"single_choice","question":"△ABC 中，b = 4、c = 6、∠A = 150°，則 △ABC 的面積為何？","options":["6√3","12","6","3"],"answer":"6","explanation":"面積 = ½·b·c·sinA = ½·4·6·sin150° = 12 · ½ = 6。sin150° = sin30° = 1/2；若誤用 cos150° 或 sin60° 會得到 (A)。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":null,"version":"2","createdDate":"2026-10-01T15:27:08.460Z","knowledgePoint":"三角形面積公式（兩邊夾角）","difficulty":"易","reference":"AI 自編（非課本原題），依 tm_1 段考命題範圍「三角形面積公式（兩邊夾角）」出題；答案經程式數值驗算（source/verify-tm1.js）","supplementId":"tm_18"},{"id":"tm_18_q5","materialId":"tm_1","questionNumber":"5","type":"single_choice","question":"△ABC 中，∠A = 45°、∠B = 60°、a = 2√2，則 b = ？","options":["√6","2√3","3√2","4"],"answer":"2√3","explanation":"正弦定理 a / sinA = b / sinB，b = a·sinB / sinA = 2√2 · (√3/2) / (√2/2) = 2√2 · √3 / √2 = 2√3。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":null,"version":"2","createdDate":"2026-10-01T15:27:08.460Z","knowledgePoint":"正弦定理（已知兩角一邊）","difficulty":"中等","reference":"AI 自編（非課本原題），依 tm_1 段考命題範圍「正弦定理（已知兩角一邊）」出題；答案經程式數值驗算（source/verify-tm1.js）","supplementId":"tm_18"},{"id":"tm_18_q6","materialId":"tm_1","questionNumber":"6","type":"single_choice","question":"三邊長分別為 5、7、8 的三角形，面積為何？","options":["10√3","20√3","10","5√3"],"answer":"10√3","explanation":"以海龍公式：s = (5 + 7 + 8)/2 = 10，面積 = √(10·5·3·2) = √300 = 10√3。也可先用餘弦定理求 7 所對的角：cosθ = (25 + 64 − 49)/(2·5·8) = 1/2，θ = 60°，面積 = ½·5·8·sin60° = 10√3。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":null,"version":"2","createdDate":"2026-10-01T15:27:08.460Z","knowledgePoint":"海龍公式、餘弦定理","difficulty":"中等","reference":"AI 自編（非課本原題），依 tm_1 段考命題範圍「海龍公式、餘弦定理」出題；答案經程式數值驗算（source/verify-tm1.js）","supplementId":"tm_18"},{"id":"tm_18_q7","materialId":"tm_1","questionNumber":"7","type":"single_choice","question":"三角形的三邊長為下列哪一組時，它是鈍角三角形？","options":["3、4、5","5、12、13","6、7、8","4、5、7"],"answer":"4、5、7","explanation":"設最長邊為 c，c² > a² + b² 時最大角為鈍角。(D) 7² = 49 > 4² + 5² = 41，是鈍角三角形。(A)(B) 剛好相等，是直角三角形；(C) 64 < 36 + 49 = 85，是銳角三角形。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":null,"version":"2","createdDate":"2026-10-01T15:27:08.460Z","knowledgePoint":"以邊長判斷三角形的形狀（餘弦定理）","difficulty":"中等","reference":"AI 自編（非課本原題），依 tm_1 段考命題範圍「以邊長判斷三角形的形狀（餘弦定理）」出題；答案經程式數值驗算（source/verify-tm1.js）","supplementId":"tm_18"},{"id":"tm_18_q8","materialId":"tm_1","questionNumber":"8","type":"single_choice","question":"△ABC 中，sinA : sinB : sinC = 3 : 5 : 7，則 △ABC 的最大角為多少？","options":["90°","120°","135°","150°"],"answer":"120°","explanation":"由正弦定理 a : b : c = sinA : sinB : sinC = 3 : 5 : 7，可設 a = 3k、b = 5k、c = 7k。最大角是 ∠C：cosC = (9k² + 25k² − 49k²)/(2·3k·5k) = −15k²/30k² = −1/2，所以 C = 120°。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":null,"version":"2","createdDate":"2026-10-01T15:27:08.460Z","knowledgePoint":"正弦定理（邊長比＝正弦比）、餘弦定理","difficulty":"中等","reference":"AI 自編（非課本原題），依 tm_1 段考命題範圍「正弦定理（邊長比＝正弦比）、餘弦定理」出題；答案經程式數值驗算（source/verify-tm1.js）","supplementId":"tm_18"},{"id":"tm_18_q9","materialId":"tm_1","questionNumber":"9","type":"single_choice","question":"△ABC 中，a = 10、sinA = 5/13，則外接圓半徑 R = ？","options":["26","13/2","10","13"],"answer":"13","explanation":"2R = a / sinA = 10 ÷ (5/13) = 26，所以 R = 13。選 (A) 是把 2R 當成 R。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":null,"version":"2","createdDate":"2026-10-01T15:27:08.460Z","knowledgePoint":"正弦定理與外接圓半徑","difficulty":"易","reference":"AI 自編（非課本原題），依 tm_1 段考命題範圍「正弦定理與外接圓半徑」出題；答案經程式數值驗算（source/verify-tm1.js）","supplementId":"tm_18"},{"id":"tm_18_q10","materialId":"tm_1","questionNumber":"10","type":"single_choice","question":"平行四邊形 ABCD 中，AB = 6、AD = 8、∠BAD = 60°，則平行四邊形 ABCD 的面積為何？","options":["12√3","24","24√3","48"],"answer":"24√3","explanation":"對角線 BD 把平行四邊形分成兩個全等三角形，每個面積 ½·6·8·sin60° = 12√3，所以平行四邊形面積 = 2 × 12√3 = 24√3（等於 AB·AD·sin∠BAD）。選 (A) 是只算了一個三角形。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":null,"version":"2","createdDate":"2026-10-01T15:27:08.460Z","knowledgePoint":"三角形面積公式的應用","difficulty":"中等","reference":"AI 自編（非課本原題），依 tm_1 段考命題範圍「三角形面積公式的應用」出題；答案經程式數值驗算（source/verify-tm1.js）","groupId":"tm_18_g1","supplementId":"tm_18"},{"id":"tm_18_q11","materialId":"tm_1","questionNumber":"11","type":"single_choice","question":"承上題，平行四邊形 ABCD（AB = 6、AD = 8、∠BAD = 60°）中，較短的對角線 BD 長為何？","options":["2√13","2√37","10","14"],"answer":"2√13","explanation":"在 △ABD 中用餘弦定理：BD² = 6² + 8² − 2·6·8·cos60° = 36 + 64 − 48 = 52，BD = 2√13。另一條對角線 AC 所對的角是 120°，AC² = 36 + 64 + 48 = 148，AC = 2√37，較長，所以 (B) 是較長的對角線。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":null,"version":"2","createdDate":"2026-10-01T15:27:08.460Z","knowledgePoint":"餘弦定理的應用（平行四邊形對角線）","difficulty":"難","reference":"AI 自編（非課本原題），依 tm_1 段考命題範圍「餘弦定理的應用（平行四邊形對角線）」出題；答案經程式數值驗算（source/verify-tm1.js）","groupId":"tm_18_g1","supplementId":"tm_18"},{"id":"tm_18_q12","materialId":"tm_1","questionNumber":"12","type":"single_choice","question":"測量員在河岸的 A、B 兩點測得 AB = 100 公尺，對岸一點 C 滿足 ∠CAB = 75°、∠CBA = 45°，則 A 到 C 的距離為多少公尺？","options":["50√6","100√6/3","50√2","100√3/3"],"answer":"100√6/3","explanation":"∠C = 180° − 75° − 45° = 60°。正弦定理：AC / sin∠B = AB / sin∠C，AC = 100 · sin45° / sin60° = 100 · (√2/2) / (√3/2) = 100√2/√3 = 100√6/3（約 81.6 公尺）。注意 AC 對的是 ∠B，不是 ∠A。","questionSource":"AI_GENERATED","origin":"AI","page":null,"version":"2","createdDate":"2026-10-01T15:27:08.460Z","knowledgePoint":"正弦定理的應用（測量）","difficulty":"難","reference":"AI 自編（非課本原題），依 tm_1 段考命題範圍「正弦定理的應用（測量）」出題；答案經程式數值驗算（source/verify-tm1.js）","supplementId":"tm_18"},{"id":"tm_27_q1","materialId":"tm_1","questionNumber":"1","type":"single_choice","question":"坐標平面上，以原點 O 為圓心、1 為半徑作圓，分別交坐標軸正向於 A、B 兩點。在第一象限的圓弧上取一點 C 作圓的切線分別交兩軸於點 D、E，如圖所示。（原卷附圖略，本題作答不需參考）令 ∠OEC = θ，試選出為 tanθ 的選項。","options":["OE","OC","OD","CE","CD"],"answer":"CD","explanation":"（詳解為 AI 撰寫）切線垂直於過切點的半徑，所以 ∠OCD = ∠OCE = 90°。在直角三角形 OCE 中，∠EOC = 90° − θ，因此 ∠COD = θ。在直角三角形 OCD 中，tanθ = 對邊 ÷ 鄰邊 = CD ÷ OC = CD ÷ 1 = CD。注意原卷的選項編號是 (1)～(5)，這裡依平台格式改為 (A)～(E)，正確答案是原卷的 (5)。","questionSource":"PAST_EXAM","origin":"Past Exam","page":null,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-02T14:09:54.781Z","knowledgePoint":"直角三角形的正切、圓的切線","difficulty":"中等","reference":"112學年度學科能力測驗 數學A考科 第2題（大考中心）","mapping":{"lesson":"第二冊 第4章 三角函數的性質","section":null,"fit":"完全對應","note":"用直角三角形的邊角關係定義 tanθ，並利用切線垂直半徑，屬本章；平台未記錄本章各節名稱，故不標節次。"},"supplementId":"tm_27"},{"id":"tm_27_q2","materialId":"tm_1","questionNumber":"2","type":"single_choice","question":"（第18–20題為題組）坐標平面上 O 為原點，給定 A(1,0)、B(−2,0) 兩點。另有兩點 P、Q 在上半平面，且滿足 AP = OA、BQ = OB、∠POQ 為直角，如圖所示。（原卷附圖略，本題作答不需參考）令 ∠AOP = θ。根據上述，試回答下列問題。 線段 OP 長為下列哪一選項？","options":["sinθ","cosθ","2sinθ","2cosθ","cos2θ"],"answer":"2cosθ","explanation":"（詳解為 AI 撰寫）AP = OA = 1，所以 △OAP 是等腰三角形，兩個底角相等：∠AOP = ∠APO = θ。也可以用餘弦定理：AP² = OA² + OP² − 2·OA·OP·cosθ，即 1 = 1 + OP² − 2·OP·cosθ，得 OP = 2cosθ。注意原卷的選項編號是 (1)～(5)，這裡依平台格式改為 (A)～(E)，正確答案是原卷的 (4)。","questionSource":"PAST_EXAM","origin":"Past Exam","page":null,"version":"1","createdDate":"2026-10-02T14:09:54.781Z","knowledgePoint":"餘弦定理、等腰三角形","difficulty":"中等","reference":"112學年度學科能力測驗 數學A考科 第18題（第18–20題題組，大考中心）","mapping":{"lesson":"第二冊 第4章 三角函數的性質","section":null,"fit":"完全對應","note":"以餘弦定理（或等腰三角形的邊角關係）求邊長，屬本章；平台未記錄本章各節名稱，故不標節次。"},"supplementId":"tm_27"}]};
